id=chromefix
name=Chrome / AppZygote zygote_next fix
version=1.1
versionCode=2
author=Luminous418
description=Keeps the A34 libzygote.dylib.so and skips the FileDescriptorRegistry audit that aborts the AppZygote subspecies, so apps with android:useAppZygote (Chromium-based browsers) no longer freeze system_server.
order=50
